Package: linus-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         plymouth,
         plymouth-themes
Recommends: grub2-common
Description: linus visual identity and branding assets
 Provides the full linus visual identity: os-release, Plymouth boot theme,
 default wallpaper, logo/icon assets, default mantle theme tokens and config,
 gtkgreet stylesheet, and GRUB boot-menu branding.
 .
 All assets are installed at stable paths consumed by the greeter, session,
 and image streams.
